Domino third-party notices

Domino manages Mihomo as a separate executable. Public CLI wheels and runtime
archives do not contain a Mihomo binary or user proxy configurations. Installation
downloads a selected upstream release; private deployment archives can contain it.

Mihomo: https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo
